# Clearing the due date prompt and pressing Enter removes @due, also from inside Today.
file <<END
- Report @due({today}) @red
- Mail @due({today})
END
keys gt
see Report
keys md
see Due date
keys <BS>
see No date: Enter removes it
keys <Enter>
hide Report
quit
saved <<END
- Report @red
- Mail @due({today})
END
